show "=== Research session contract ==="

remember a string called source-state with "scanned"
remember a string called claim-basis with "document"
remember a string called cross-reference-status with "partial"
remember a list called sources-consulted with "none"
remember a list called claims-recorded with "none"
remember a list called claims-cross-referenced with "none"
remember a number called source-count with 0

remember how to cite from source: show source

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: source not yet read — cannot cite it"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: claim is inferred, not grounded in a verified source"

when cross-reference-status is equal to "complete"
  show "OK: all claims cross-referenced across sources"

show "--- sources consulted ---"
add "source-inception-checkpoint" to sources-consulted
add "source-add-verb-addendum" to sources-consulted
add "source-build-checkpoint" to sources-consulted
show sources-consulted
count sources-consulted

show "--- claims recorded ---"
add "claim-cross-model-convergence" to claims-recorded
add "claim-bounded-vocab-forces-precision" to claims-recorded
add "claim-tiered-operation-pattern" to claims-recorded

show "--- only multi-source claims advance ---"
add "claim-cross-model-convergence" to claims-cross-referenced
add "claim-bounded-vocab-forces-precision" to claims-cross-referenced

show claims-recorded
show claims-cross-referenced

show "--- routing on cross-reference completeness ---"
choose if cross-reference-status is equal to "complete": show "publish the synthesis" otherwise show "more cross-checking needed"

cite from claim-basis
